@startuml
'==== Title ====
title US008 - "As an Administrator, I want to register a new city in the system" - SSD
hidefootbox

'==== basic style ====
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Futura
skinparam objectFontSize 20
skinparam backgroundColor CornSilk
skinparam objectBackgroundColor WhiteSmoke
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFE0
skinparam ArrowFontColor #3B4953

autonumber
autoactivate off

actor Administrator
participant "MiteLovers" as MiteLovers

Administrator -> MiteLovers: open "Register city" screen
activate MiteLovers
MiteLovers --> Administrator: show form (city name + country picker)
Administrator -> MiteLovers: fill form + submit
MiteLovers --> Administrator: show confirmation / error
@enduml
